{"ID":"20251113103358-am9xr9g","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20251113103358-am9xr9g","title":"UPL9-14——光照探针","type":"doc","updated":"20251113165004"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113103358-v7jr8hw","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20251113103358-v7jr8hw","name":"Light Probe","updated":"20251113165004"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"光照探针"}]},{"ID":"20251113103419-d176pm9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113103419-d176pm9","updated":"20251113164440"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"上一篇提到的光照烘焙，主要是为静态物体服务的，静态物体的光照信息直接烘焙进了光照贴图中\n而动态物体由于自身会不停移动，受光影响的结果是不能直接烘焙进贴图的，所以烘焙光照无法作用于动态物体上\n如果需要让动态物体收到直接光照，可以将光源改为 Mixed 模式，不过动态物体依然不能受到间接光的影响"}]},{"ID":"20251113103419-ofuj1dz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113103419-ofuj1dz","updated":"20251113165004"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"而光照探针（Light Probe）可以用于解决 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"烘焙光源产生的间接光不能作用于动态物体"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 的问题，它让动态物体在场景中通过插值获得周围环境的间接光信息"}]},{"ID":"20251113103419-dmgi7b7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113103419-dmgi7b7","updated":"20251113103446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"间接光照（Indirect Lighting）是由光线在场景中经过一次或多次反射后，再照射到物体表面的光照"}]},{"ID":"20251113103448-za1gubv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113103448-za1gubv","updated":"20251113103454"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"举例："}]},{"ID":"20251113103454-hfkqitq","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251113103454-hfkqitq","updated":"20251113103454"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113103454-3kn9da0","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251113103454-3kn9da0","updated":"20251113103454"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113103454-57exp7o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113103454-57exp7o","updated":"20251113103502"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"灯直接照在桌面上为 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"直接光照"}]}]},{"ID":"20251113103455-ls6ear5","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251113103455-ls6ear5","updated":"20251113103455"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113103455-on2dc6a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113103455-on2dc6a","updated":"20251113103506"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桌面反射的光线照亮了墙壁、天花板为 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"间接光照"}]}]},{"ID":"20251113103455-5wx7wta","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251113103455-5wx7wta","updated":"20251113103455"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113103455-xayguas","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113103455-xayguas","updated":"20251113103511"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"墙壁又反射出微弱的光照亮房间阴暗处为 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"多次间接光照"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251113150258-4qjmh5h","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20251113150258-4qjmh5h","style":"background-color: var(--b3-card-warning-background); color: var(--b3-card-warning-color); --b3-parent-background: var(--b3-card-warning-background);","updated":"20251113164515"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20251113150259-mbr4ftw","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20251113150259-mbr4ftw","updated":"20251113164041"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20251113150304-nmp2ge6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113150304-nmp2ge6","updated":"20251113150340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"光照探针"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"只会烘焙间接光"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这就意味着，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"如果一个动态物体希望受到某个光源（比如点光源）的直接光影响，那么我们需要将该光源设置为混合（Mixed）光源！"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n这样对于动态物体来说，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"该光源对它的直接光照，通过实时计算表现"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"而间接光照通过光照探针计算"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"！\n这样光照探针就优化了关于间接光照的表现和计算，而直接光源还是在 Shader 当中计算出颜色表现！"}]},{"ID":"20251113163954-zkqszwj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113163954-zkqszwj","updated":"20251113163954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对于动态物体："}]},{"ID":"20251113163954-pc9kqo3","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251113163954-pc9kqo3","updated":"20251113164009"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113164009-s7m3ojd","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251113164009-s7m3ojd","updated":"20251113164009"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113164009-uw818uq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113164009-uw818uq","updated":"20251113164009"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"想要受光源直接光 → 光源设为 Mixed 或 Realtime"}]}]},{"ID":"20251113164009-xjwscoj","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251113164009-xjwscoj","updated":"20251113164009"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113164009-8i4wm05","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113164009-8i4wm05","updated":"20251113164009"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"想要受间接光 → 启用 Light Probe"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251113163954-9l5wcu0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113163954-9l5wcu0","updated":"20251113164033"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"了解这一点非常重要，这样我们就可以根据我们的实际需求进行取舍！\n光照探针只是间接光照的优化方案，用于让动态物体获得逼真的环境光效果，而无需实时全局光照计算。\n不用再让 CPU / GPU 实时计算复杂的光线反射了！"}]}]},{"ID":"20251113164506-5xxorfm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113164506-5xxorfm","updated":"20251113164511"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"例如如下场景："}]},{"ID":"20251113164452-w3yayo8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113164452-w3yayo8","updated":"20251113164521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20251113164502-v6zyog7.png"},{"Type":"NodeLinkSpace"},{"Type":"NodeLinkTitle","Data":"救护车的侧面是单调的灰色，但它应该从建筑物的前方接受一些红色的反射光。"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20251113164041-1t8jllb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113164041-1t8jllb","updated":"20251113164543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"添加探针并在场景中烘焙光照后，动态移动对象将根据场景中最近的探针接收间接光："}]},{"ID":"20251113164543-bb4mvyz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113164543-bb4mvyz","updated":"20251113164558"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20251113164549-w9zbv94.png"},{"Type":"NodeLinkSpace"},{"Type":"NodeLinkTitle","Data":"救护车的侧面现在呈现红色，因为它通过场景中的光照探针从建筑物的前方接受了红色的反射光。"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20251113103512-qy5frmc","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251113103512-qy5frmc","updated":"20251113103652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"光照探针（Light Probe）的原理"}]},{"ID":"20251113103524-qc2fx5v","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251113103524-qc2fx5v","updated":"20251113103615"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113103538-h6sktmx","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251113103538-h6sktmx","updated":"20251113103538"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113103538-wd6prgy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113103538-wd6prgy","updated":"20251113103538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"烘焙阶段"}]},{"ID":"20251113103540-wumgyte","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113103540-wumgyte","updated":"20251113103553"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在场景中放置多个光照探针点，Unity 会对每个光照探针点计算来自周围的光照方向和强度分布\n这些光照数据不是用贴图存储，而是存储为 球谐函数（Spherical Harmonics, SH）系数"}]},{"ID":"20251113103553-bvdl3yc","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20251113103553-bvdl3yc","updated":"20251113103555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20251113103555-aavcxz1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113103555-aavcxz1","updated":"20251113103556"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"球谐函数（Spherical Harmonics）:"}]},{"ID":"20251113103559-0jbifkv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113103559-0jbifkv","updated":"20251113103601"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"是一族由同一个通用公式定义出来的函数，是一个模板公式，通过不同的参数生成许多具体的函数\n在图形学中的作用是把球面方向上的光照分布用有限个系数（基函数）近似表示出来\n利用球谐函数，我们能够根据表面法线方向，计算出该方向上的环境光照颜色"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251113103538-05glqsg","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251113103538-05glqsg","updated":"20251113103615"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113103538-iglirk2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113103538-iglirk2","updated":"20251113103538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"运行阶段"}]},{"ID":"20251113103613-5kdg7h3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113103613-5kdg7h3","updated":"20251113103615"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对于每个动态物体，Unity在空间中找到它附近的光照探针\n根据物体所在位置，对这些光照探针的数据进行三维插值\n将插值计算得到的光照应用到物体上，模拟出真实的光照环境"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251113103524-wkc3l9w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113103524-wkc3l9w","updated":"20251113103623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"总结：在场景中预先采样并用球谐函数记录各点的环境光分布，运行时通过插值这些数据让动态物体获得逼真的间接光照"}]},{"ID":"20251113103524-afisfso","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113103524-afisfso","updated":"20251113103632"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"优点："}]},{"ID":"20251113103632-4jbau44","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251113103632-4jbau44","updated":"20251113103637"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113103632-x3lvg30","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251113103632-x3lvg30","updated":"20251113103637"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113103632-4hwvul6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113103632-4hwvul6","updated":"20251113103637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"几乎零运行时成本（插值 + Shader 乘法）"}]}]},{"ID":"20251113103632-rigtz5p","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251113103632-rigtz5p","updated":"20251113103632"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113103632-ns5m6cz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113103632-ns5m6cz","updated":"20251113103632"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"光照平滑过渡"}]}]},{"ID":"20251113103632-9ag099u","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251113103632-9ag099u","updated":"20251113103632"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113103632-rkt9iia","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113103632-rkt9iia","updated":"20251113103632"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"能与烘焙光照无缝结合"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251113103625-p0hayuq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113103625-p0hayuq","updated":"20251113103630"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"缺点："}]},{"ID":"20251113103630-7b811me","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251113103630-7b811me","updated":"20251113103630"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113103630-gwasnco","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251113103630-gwasnco","updated":"20251113103630"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113103630-163v6ot","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113103630-163v6ot","updated":"20251113103630"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"无法产生阴影（只是光照颜色变化）"}]}]},{"ID":"20251113103630-n9zg9kc","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251113103630-n9zg9kc","updated":"20251113103630"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113103630-q6wmmis","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113103630-q6wmmis","updated":"20251113103630"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"光照数据是静态的（烘焙时固定）"}]}]},{"ID":"20251113103630-jmsrhw5","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251113103630-jmsrhw5","updated":"20251113103630"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113103630-cw8jmlf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113103630-cw8jmlf","updated":"20251113103630"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"探针过少时容易出现亮度跳变"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251113103652-5xdmr35","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251113103652-5xdmr35","updated":"20251113164754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"光照探针（Light Probe）的使用"}]},{"ID":"20251113103706-a9o9pe8","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251113103706-a9o9pe8","updated":"20251113164754"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113103710-ehoflz8","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251113103710-ehoflz8","updated":"20251113103710"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251113103710-avjmol9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113103710-avjmol9","updated":"20251113103710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在场景中创建 Light Probe Group（光照探针组）"}]},{"ID":"20251113103710-1rjfl37","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113103710-1rjfl37","updated":"20251113103710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"场景上会出现很多黄色小球，一个小球就是一个探针点"}]},{"ID":"20251113151322-ueacqen","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113151322-ueacqen","updated":"20251113151357"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在 Hierarchy 窗口内右键选择 Light —— Light Probe Group 即可创建"}]},{"ID":"20251113151318-lkut4nc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251113151318-lkut4nc","updated":"20251113151318"},"Children":[{"Type":"